<h2>Buổi 2 &mdash; Khoá và siết</h2>

<figure class="fig fig-seal"><img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/taichinow/taichinow-media/main/assets/books/jiujitsu/img/p039_f1.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure>
