<figure class="fig"><img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/taichinow/taichinow-media/main/assets/books/jiujitsu/img/p053_f1.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><figcaption><span class="lang-vi"><span class="figno">A</span>Đưa cánh tay trái tới trước (1). Nắm chặt bàn tay.</span></figcaption></figure>
